<title>POLAND: Wedel sets issue price for PepsiCo.</title>
<headline>Wedel sets issue price for PepsiCo.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish confectionery maker Wedel SA set the price for its new 145,713 share issue to PepsiCo Finance Limited at 95.36 zlotys per share, Wedel said in an issue prospectus.</p>
<p>PepsiCo currently has about 3.9 million of Wedel's 5.8 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
